linux-redmi-marble (7.2.8+marble3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * /boot now carries only what the boot chain reads: vmlinuz-<ver>
    (the uncompressed Image, U-Boot booti) and
    sm8475-xiaomi-marble-<ver>.dtb. Dropped the Image-<ver> duplicate,
    Image.gz-<ver>, System.map-<ver> and config-<ver>.
  * Fixed the DTB install name: it was sm8475-xiaomi-marble.dtb-<ver>.dtb,
    which does not match what postinst looks for. Now
    sm8475-xiaomi-marble-<ver>.dtb (sheng-style, version before the
    extension).
  * Dropped the dracut dependency and the shipped dracut conf: this is the
    no-initramfs direct-boot route and postinst never generates an
    initramfs. Installing dracut also pulled it in only to displace
    initramfs-tools.

